  "Id": 3354,
  "Title": "Embracing diversity at AKU-ISMC! ",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "The celebration of \"Nowruz\" within our AKU-ISMC student engagement programme was truly special",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": "<div class=\"ExternalClassEB78961E57F745518C43E1CA194CD236\"><div>On March 20th, AKU-ISMC was alive with the festive spirit of &quot;Nowruz&quot; as we celebrated together in our student engagement scheme, showing our commitment to welcoming everyone and being united.<br></div><div><br></div><div>Our programme brings students from different backgrounds together to share and enjoy each other's cultures. Through fun activities and events, we create a friendly space where everyone feels included and valued.</div><div><br></div><div>During the Nowruz celebration, students had a great time sharing traditions and enjoying the diversity of our community. It was a happy day filled with laughter and friendship, showing how much we appreciate each other's differences.</div><div><br><br></div><p>As we reflect on this joyous occasion, let it serve as a reminder of the importance of nurturing inclusivity and respect for all cultures within our AKU-ISMC family. Together, let us continue to cultivate an environment where diversity is celebrated, and cultural unity flourishes, enriching the fabric of our shared experience.&#160;<br></p><p><br></p></div>",
